# Surface Pro 12 (Intel): the IPU7 PSYS (hardware ISP) node is root-only by
# default. Give it to the video group and to the seated user (uaccess ACL),
# as the other camera nodes are. The hardware-ISP relays (sp12-camera-hal)
# are started by this device appearing rather than enabled statically: on a
# kernel without the PSYS driver they stay off, and their loopback devices,
# having no writer, are not offered as cameras.
KERNEL=="ipu7-psys[0-9]*", GROUP="video", MODE="0660", TAG+="uaccess", TAG+="systemd", \
  ENV{SYSTEMD_WANTS}+="v4l2-relayd@sp12-front.service v4l2-relayd@sp12-rear.service"
